.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDASH 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdash
.Nd interactive task picker for zdots workflows
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -list | Fl -preview Ar id
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens an fzf-powered task picker wired to
.Xr ztask 1 ,
Pi exploration, Aider implementation, and platform status views.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -list
Print task list for fzf input.
.It Fl -preview Ar id
Print a formatted task preview.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh KEYBINDINGS
.Bl -tag -width "ctrl-s"
.It Enter
Start selected task with
.Xr ztask 1 .
.It Ctrl-p
Open Pi exploration for the selected task.
.It Ctrl-a
Open Aider implementation.
.It Ctrl-s
Open
.Xr zdots-status 1 .
.It Ctrl-d
Mark active task done.
.It Ctrl-r
Refresh task list.
.It ?
Toggle preview pane.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ~/.local/state/zsh/active_task
.It Pa backlog/tasks/
Task files.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/active_task
Active task marker.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zmorning 1 ,
.Xr ztask 1
